## Everything else — All Rights Reserved

Everything else in this repository — the UI, MIDI player, SATB/polyphony
system, Voice DNA, presets, snowman animation, and all other original code —
is Copyright © Takeshi Kawamoto. All rights reserved.

No permission is granted to copy, redistribute, mirror, modify, or publish
a modified version of this application, in whole or in part, for any
purpose — commercial or non-commercial. The synthesized voice itself may
not be extracted, sampled, or repackaged as a standalone product (e.g. a
sample pack, voice bank, or soundfont) for sale or distribution.

**The one thing you're free to do:** use this application in your browser
to make music, and freely use whatever you create with it — songs,
recordings, and videos — including for commercial purposes.
